msgid "The {script} script configures an APT repository; that part has no effect on this system."
msgstr "El script {script} configura un repositorio APT; esa parte no tiene efecto en este sistema."

msgid "The {script} script is written in Lua for RPM itself and was skipped."
msgstr "El script {script} está escrito en Lua para el propio RPM y se omitió."

msgid "The {script} script configures a DNF/YUM repository; that part has no effect on this system."
msgstr "El script {script} configura un repositorio DNF/YUM; esa parte no tiene efecto en este sistema."
